egitimate government.", "children": [{"id": "5dbeb3e2-2491-4fcc-8a20-9b3a817ef239", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Personal identity and consciousness", "children": [{"id": "85fb4524-dd4d-43db-9041-a4f21783ef90", "type": "concept", "title": "person"}, {"id": "a742edda-19e5-4902-b080-934ffedc48f8", "type": "concept", "title": "consciousness"}, {"id": "c37afae8-90d9-410d-aeaa-e38ca005d494", "type": "concept", "title": "memory"}, {"id": "3c32bfc9-a7e1-4684-a396-adaad601812f", "type": "concept", "title": "forensic term"}, {"id": "033e4839-2eaa-4014-a96e-e138a702ad61", "type": "concept", "title": "same man"}, {"id": "0a98fe89-c2dd-4949-a2dc-ffbc4551aee4", "type": "concept", "title": "same soul"}, {"id": "ca2180d0-8a05-4971-9224-751ccf7058e3", "type": "concept", "title": "same person"}, {"id": "156e64a1-28b0-47cb-a227-04dabdc6aa97", "type": "concept", "title": "responsibility"}, {"id": "495456c6-21ec-4dbf-b8ac-3f515389902f", "type": "concept", "title": "appropriation"}, {"id": "f0bbd572-1a53-444e-abfd-59841e2e8369", "type": "concept", "title": "Prince and Cobbler"}], "description": "Students learn Locke's shift from substance to consciousness in defining persons."}, {"id": "24bd3b17-4554-4058-962e-b11ece3c2473", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Property and labor", "children": [{"id": "ca6e33e1-ff92-48c9-99da-c2d96055a8e9", "type": "concept", "title": "state of nature"}, {"id": "35b93746-44f6-40aa-9e8e-40a78ba572b8", "type": "concept", "title": "natural law"}, {"id": "f64c2360-e008-4d24-b897-70527f8a2e84", "type": "concept", "title": "labor mixing"}, {"id": "b79645ed-0dd0-4c04-8cd6-c609e6b446df", "type": "concept", "title": "property right"}, {"id": "647ecec2-b8dd-4202-a7cd-d9f0a020caa3", "type": "concept", "title": "enough and as good"}, {"id": "66a85116-9c20-41e7-92b8-e9193fb58a37", "type": "concept", "title": "spoilage proviso"}, {"id": "bb9528bf-34b3-4f84-9544-736a86f4b86e", "type": "concept", "title": "money"}, {"id": "6104edb1-2822-4226-835a-d6ec7b076c05", "type": "conc