reats space and time as forms of human sensibility."}, {"id": "ccacdf2b-8dba-4dc5-a467-d0c4d37211e1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Categories and understanding", "children": [{"id": "00f97986-1ff1-4372-8bcf-ddd920185ef1", "type": "concept", "title": "category"}, {"id": "b98dc956-9875-4a1e-b135-033c6a70e274", "type": "concept", "title": "understanding"}, {"id": "c5289482-c6d2-424d-9c5a-cb1376f1a21c", "type": "concept", "title": "quantity"}, {"id": "ee0cde2d-cba7-4cf9-8c5e-8d95bb01b635", "type": "concept", "title": "quality"}, {"id": "cb50a89a-8b58-405c-9c70-69de3aa922f1", "type": "concept", "title": "relation"}, {"id": "6f26be97-1a99-4c81-ae31-5d3d0535283a", "type": "concept", "title": "modality"}, {"id": "4faf6e03-f0f3-449b-b250-23d5e196bd6b", "type": "concept", "title": "unity of apperception"}, {"id": "e83dd130-9585-4266-83ec-16abc36fd07d", "type": "concept", "title": "transcendental deduction"}, {"id": "20457232-5a45-444f-b412-dbc314dd8d07", "type": "concept", "title": "synthesis"}, {"id": "ce4c05ce-7a1e-45f4-9489-1cad2b45c751", "type": "concept", "title": "object of experience"}], "description": "This section introduces the conceptual structure Kant says makes experience possible."}, {"id": "813dcd5c-1191-4c26-aab2-21c3b902d9e8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Causation and the analogies of experience", "children": [{"id": "13a3a1ef-0017-4ea3-84ab-339f1f029044", "type": "concept", "title": "schema"}, {"id": "09690d88-f057-4004-b36e-7eacaf9ea724", "type": "concept", "title": "schematism"}, {"id": "83c96ede-2f1b-4ece-99f7-b1f6d59faf50", "type": "concept", "title": "substance"}, {"id": "9a2cfd68-ed1e-4718-b007-9fe4b20b961c", "type": "concept", "title": "causality"}, {"id": "0f5d253f-5e25-4778-a2a2-25e8359ad8ee", "type": "concept", "title": "community"}, {"id": "e299d0d5-9dbf-4c4d-a7ce-3055ac2f7ce0", "type": "concept", "title": "analogy of experience"}, {"id": "148303bf-ac65-4a8c-9dee-02dd00258665", "type": "concept", "title": "objective succession"}, {"id": "e17f0c